# A checkbox by mouse and keys (3-E3b). `visible` is at x 4..17, y 3..16
# (13 px with margins 3px 3px 3px 4px), `hidden` at x 61..74 and checked,
# `off` at x 118..131 and disabled.
listen pointerdown pointerup click input change keydown keyup focusin
click 10 10                   a click toggles on, with input and change after the click
expect event pointerdown input#visible
expect event pointerup input#visible
expect event click input#visible
expect event input input#visible
expect event change input#visible
expect focus input#visible
expect checked input#visible true
click 10 10                   and off again
expect event change input#visible
expect checked input#visible false
key Space                     Space toggles on keyup
expect event keydown input#visible
expect event keyup input#visible
expect event click input#visible
expect event change input#visible
expect checked input#visible true
key Enter                     Enter does nothing to a checkbox
expect no event click
expect checked input#visible true
key Tab                       to the checked one
expect focus-visible input#hidden
expect checked input#hidden true
key Space
expect checked input#hidden false
click 124 10                  off is disabled: no click, no focus, no change
expect event pointerdown input#off
expect no event click
expect no event change
expect focus body
expect checked input#off false
